---
description: How this project uses Movoice AI calling (read AGENTS.md first)
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` in the project root before changing anything about calls or webhooks.

- Keep the Movoice API key on the server only. Never put it in browser code or commit it.
- Every webhook must have its signature checked and repeats skipped by the delivery id (`X-Movoice-Delivery`, the same as `event_id`), exactly as the existing webhook route does.
- To add Movoice calling to another project, follow https://www.movoice.ai/setup.md step by step.
